# 🤖 AI RAG Assistant

An AI-powered Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application that allows users to upload PDF documents and ask questions in natural language. The system retrieves the most relevant information using semantic search and generates accurate, context-aware answers with the Llama 3.3 Large Language Model.

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

🌐 **Website:** https://ai-rag-assistant-seven.vercel.app

⚡ **Backend API:** https://nouraelhoseny13-ai-rag-assistant-backend.hf.space

